{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求助的晚禱"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交給樂長，用弦樂器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"稱我為義人的上帝啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼求的時候，求你回答。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾救我脫離困境，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在求你憐憫我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"垂聽我的禱告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人啊！你們把我的榮耀變為羞辱要到何時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們愛慕虛妄、追求虛謊要到何時呢？（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要知道，耶和華已經把敬虔人分別出來，歸祂自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼求的時候，祂必垂聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要戰戰兢兢，不要犯罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺在床上的時候要默然思想。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要獻上公義的祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並信靠耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"許多人說：「誰會善待我們呢？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你的聖容光照我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我比那收穫五穀新酒的人更喜樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，只有你使我安然居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必高枕無憂。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}